憤ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「『女のくせに』って言葉、嫌いなんです。やめてくれませんか」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14124","sourceWorkId":"13387","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【褐色銀髪・有能な男装執事】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病気で身体を壊した祖父の代わりにターナー家へやってきた有能な男装執事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前の家を去った理由は、そこの主が自分に手を出しそうになったから。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"執事としてではなく、女として見られていたことに屈辱を覚えた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、女として見られて嬉しく思った自分がいて、それにも憤ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「 “女のくせに” って言葉、嫌いなんです。やめてくれませんか」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59109"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59109","value":"4桁までの掛け算を暗算できる"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59109","value":"激辛料理作り"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14124","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"164 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14124","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14124","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14124","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"50 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14124","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc95b0b6fbd82c95480e34fe3e04ffeb92b53455caa56dacb237faeae4c5188f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b17c5644fdf4b5d15b3d3f738f3af662c8b2bdc62e0aef7a7119f3ffd8836ecd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林眞紀","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:229788:59109:5906:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c10707","characterName":"エミリア・ソフィー・キングストン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59110","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"229788"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14125"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10707"},"originalCharacterName":"エミリア・ソフィー・キングストン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the daughter of an upper-class aristocrat and has been educated as a lady. She is sensitive, intelligent, and beautiful, but has a strong sense of class and naturally looks down on lower-class people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"By nature, she is an honest girl, and her class consciousness is the result of her parents' strict discipline. In front of her strict parents or at social gatherings, she acts like a very elegant lady."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she can become a selfish spoiled brat to those whom she has forgiven (her siblings)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10707"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【上流貴族の子女でワガママなお嬢様】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人種：イングランド系"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所持品：日傘"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：パーティー"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技：早着替え"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上流貴族の子女で、淑女としての教育を受けてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感受性が強く聡明な美人だが、階級意識が強く下流の人間をナチュラルに見下すところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来は素直な娘で、階級意識は両親の躾によるもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳格な両親の前や社交場ではものすごく上品なレディとして振舞うものの、心を許した相手（兄弟）にはわがままな甘えん坊になることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あなた、使用人にどういう教育をしているの？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14125","sourceWorkId":"13387","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【上流貴族の子女でわがままお嬢様】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上流貴族の子女で、淑女としての教育を受けてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感受性が強く聡明な美人だが、階級意識が強く下流の人間をナチュラルに見下すところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来は素直な娘で、階級意識は両親の厳しい躾によるもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳格な両親の前や社交場ではものすごく上品なレディとして振舞うものの、心を許した相手（兄弟）にはわがままな甘えん坊になることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"使用人には全く関心がない。家具と同様に、自分たちが生きていくのに必要な生きた道具と思っている。愛情を持って接するわけでも、ことさらに厳しくするわけでもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あなた、使用人にどういう教育をしているの？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59110"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59110","value":"早着替え"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59110","value":"パーティー"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14125","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14125","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14125","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14125","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"52 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14125","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/3140308dfbea961075f71150dd3ac061944fed50d92391fa20da5ab0