趣味：一人で森を歩く"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"役職：ハウスメイド"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ジョナサンの屋敷に新しくやってきたメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りが激しく他人とはめったに口をきかない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何か悩み事があっても自分の内に閉じこもってしまうタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虚弱体質で気が弱く全体的に控えめなとっても地味な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に特別扱い（身の回りの世話、性的奉仕も含む）されてからは、他のメイドたちからいじめを受けることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「…………わかりました、ご主人様……」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14122","sourceWorkId":"13387","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【主人公の家にやって来た、引っ込み思案で健気なメイドさん】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウィルの屋敷に新しくやってきたメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"育ってきた不遇な境遇のせいか、なにか辛いことがあっても抵抗することなく従順に受け入れてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、何か悩み事があっても自分の内に閉じこもってしまうタイプ。気が弱く、全体的に控えめなとっても地味な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に特別扱い（身の回りの世話、性的奉仕も含む）されてからは彼女の屋敷での立場は他のメイドたちと違うので、いじめを受けることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「………わかりました、ご主人様……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59107"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59107","value":"一人で森を歩く"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14122","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"154 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14122","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14122","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14122","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"46 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14122","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6ffa29d27d969570d278b525ff9c12ab3a55522dd5c03459c0439b8681a4fd2e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63f186e18d1ee0b007341a8843c1a34b76e6a244c4e8c75a81660182f0dce382.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:229788:59107:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c10711","characterName":"メアリー・アンダーソン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59108","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"229788"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14123"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10711"},"originalCharacterName":"メアリー・アンダーソン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"91"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"168"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the last remaining maid that was under Will's father, the other servants quit one after another due to Will's insanity. She is a kind-hearted head maid with a strong work ethic, and is admired and respected by the other maids."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In fact, she was the maid with whom the main character had his first experience. When Will reached puberty, she embraced him as a kind of consolation, and since then they have often had sexual relations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even if she does not get any reward at all, even if it is just an outlet for his desires, She is happy to be able to spend time alone with him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10711"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【主人公に尽くし続けるメイド長】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人種：スコットランド系"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：フリル集め"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技：裁縫（メイドたちの服を作る）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"役職：メイド長"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ジョナサンの非常識ぶりに父親時代の使用人たちが次々辞めていって、最後に残った古株のメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事熱心で心優しいメイド長で、ほかのメイドからも一目置かれて慕われる存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は主人公の初体験の相手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思春期になった主人公に、手慰みのように抱かれ、それ以来度々身体を重ねている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たとえまったく報われなくても、単なる欲望のはけ口でもいいから、主人公と二人だけの時を過ごせることを喜ばしく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ご主人様、お茶をお注ぎ致しましょうか？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14123","sourceWorkId":"13387","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【貴族から使用人に身を落としても、主人公に尽くし続ける優しいメイドさん】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウィルの非常識ぶりに父親時代の使用人たちが次々辞めていって、最後に残った古株の優しく面倒見の良いメイド長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天涯孤独となったメアリーを主人公の父親が好意で屋敷に招いたが、それを嫌がった奥方によって、メイドとして働くことになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は主人公の初体験の相手。思春期になったウィルに手慰みのように抱かれ、それ以来度々身体を重ねている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たとえ全く報われなくとも、単なる欲望のはけ口でもいいから、主人公とふたりだけの時を過ごせることを喜ばしく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ご主人様、お茶をお注ぎ致しましょうか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59108"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59108","value":"裁縫（ヒロインたちの服を作る）"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59108","value":"フリル集め"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14123","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"168 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14123","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14123","sourceWorkId":"13387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","